+      </section>
+      <section anchor="retrieving" numbered="false" removeInRFC="false" toc="exclude" pn="section-3.2">
+        <name slugifiedName="name-retrieving">Retrieving</name>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2-1">Using RR Program</t>
+        <ul spacing="normal" indent="3" pn="section-3.2-2">
+          <li pn="section-3.2-2.1">RR is a TENEX-based interactive program designed to prepare
